    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Phyllis W.",
        "date": "2024-08-01T06:26:41Z",
        "id": "66ab2aa17d470a45c317f683",
        "label": "Good",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 8,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Aug 9, 2024",
            "id": "164a7006-86d8-42ff-8e66-57dabd19830d",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hi Phyllis, thank you for sharing your experience at our property Inlet Beach Cottage. We are thrilled to hear you enjoyed your stay but disappointed that it was anything but perfect. We take all suggestions very seriously and will be looking into your suggestion's to make our property perfect. We hope to host your next stay on 30A!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Very lovely place! We enjoyed our stay. I would have given a perfect rating. But the back deck and bbq grill both need work or be replaced.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location"
        ],
        "title": "Phyllis",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Neil P.",
        "date": "2024-06-26T17:07:45Z",
        "id": "667c4ae3009b8c0ada3a4a9e",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Nov 20, 2024",
            "id": "6806cc20-f6df-4322-bc79-eb2157b52811",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "We are glad that in spite of the hiccups, you had a good stay overall, Neil. We do hope that you visit again soon.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We really enjoyed out stay at the property. The house was clean and comfortable and very convenient to the pool. Be aware that there is almost ZERO cellular signal in this area and we did not have wifi for the first couple days of our stay. The property managers did get wifi going on the third day so we were able to get online but without wifi there is almost no chance to get a cellular connection, use GPS, or search for restaurants/activities/etc. The property management did refund us $175 on our stay for the lack of wifi/internet but luckily we didn't have anyone trying to work remotely full-time. Overall this was a good stay at a nice property.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Great Property at Inlet Beach",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Angelika G.",
        "date": "2024-05-30T01:19:26Z",
        "id": "6657d427fce64372cd7136d5",
        "label": "Okay",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 6,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Nov 20, 2024",
            "id": "1db4c119-fb9f-4527-9816-55756460f9c4",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for sharing your feedback regarding your stay. We appreciate your acknowledgment of the support received by Oversee, but regret hearing of the inconveniences you experienced. We are grateful that you brought your concerns to our attention to allow us to correct and improve future experiences. We do hope that you think of Inlet Beach Cottage on your next visit to our beautiful beaches.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We had good support from the property manager, nevertheless we had no wifi and internet for 5 days and got the wrong door code to get in. The outdoor furniture were dirty. That was a disappointment, too. \nThe amenity pool is almost on the other street side.\nThe house is nice, it could have been a nice stay. I guess it was bad luck this time.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Communication",
          "Disliked: Cleanliness, check-in"
        ],
        "title": "Bad luck with wifi and internet",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Caryn V.",
        "date": "2025-04-13T16:55:31Z",
        "id": "67fbfacb214ac330f0b96cbd",
        "label": "Good",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 8,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Apr 29, 2025",
            "id": "29d0893f-3ba3-4586-b7ea-fb586d5138c1",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for taking the time to share your feedback. We're glad you found the check-in process easy and that our management team was helpful. We are disappointed to hear of the issues you encountered upon arrival. We will note the trash not being taken to the road and will try to give more precise instructions on when trash day is. We are addressing this immediately with our team to ensure this oversight does not happen again. We are also disappointed by the lack of linens for the sleeper sofa. We regret that you had to request these items. We will review our inventory procedures to ensure all advertised sleeping arrangements are properly equipped for our guests. Regarding the kitchen being under-stocked, we appreciate this specific feedback. We aim to provide more than just the bare essentials, and your comments will be valuable as we assess and potentially enhance the kitchen supplies at this property. We value your feedback as it helps us identify areas where we need to improve to provide a better experience for future guests.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Overall the house was fine. Check in was easy and management was very helpful, but the house is lacking. First of all, the trash was not taken out by the prior occupants, so the trash cans were already full when we got there, which became somewhat of a problem. Secondly, the house lists a sleeper sofa but there are no sheets, towels or blankets, so I had to call and request them. And lastly, the kitchen is under-stocked. Most of the cabinets are empty. It has the bare essentials, but if you’re hoping for anything more, you need to bring your own. House was fine for the price, but would not stay at this location again.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Check-in, communication, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Spring break 2025",
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
